  "prefLabel": "Plc 1605.03 Application for Registration Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1605.03 Application for Registration Renewal. A nurse agency that wishes to renew a registration shall submit the following to the licensing bureau:\n\n(a) A completed “Universal Application to Renew License” dated April 2024, together with the “Nurse Agency Registration Supplement to Universal Application to Renew License” dated March 2024, that provides the information required by Plc 308.06 and Plc 1605.04, and is signed and attested to as required by Plc 308.08 and Plc 1605.05;\n\n(b) The documentation required by Plc 308.07, as applicable; and\n\n(c) The application processing and licensing fee specified in Plc 1002, provided that:\n\n(1) An applicant applying to renew as active military or a military spouse shall not pay the application processing and licensing fee; and\n\n(2) If no application processing and licensing fee is specified in Plc 1002, then no fee shall be paid.\n\nSource. #13914, eff 5-6-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1600.html"
